  "details": "Modders are able to create portals with unlimited timers and place multiple in the instance at the same time.\n\nBlocking someone doesn't remove them, there's no option to hide portals. When someone decides to do this, the instance is permanently full of spam portals with no way to remove them. The only option is to create a new instance.\n\nPortals being able to do this seems to be a bug from 5+ months ago going by reddit comments about it. Portals should not be able to be unlimited or spammed all over an entire instance by a single person.\n\nTo be quick about the bug. Portal timers and number of portals are limited client side. Modded game versions can remove these limits spawning 20+ permanent portals. Players using the normal unmodified game have no system or method to hide them except leave the instance.",
